2026-09-25T04:19:07.6817620Z [36;1m[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6817880Z [36;1m# Desktop-update hand-off integration tests spawn the real[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6818270Z [36;1m# windows.ps1; deselect them unless the PR touched that surface[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6818700Z [36;1m# (see the workflow_call input). ``--ignore-glob`` keeps the file[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6819110Z [36;1m# list above intact, so a renamed test file still trips the[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6819560Z [36;1m# zero-tests guard rather than silently vanishing.[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6819930Z [36;1m# (bash 3.2 on the macOS runner: an empty array under ``set -u`` is[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6833100Z [36;1m# an unbound-variable error, hence the ``${arr[@]+...}`` idiom.)[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6833490Z [36;1mEXTRA_ARGS=()[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6833690Z [36;1mif [ "false" != "true" ]; then[0m
