2026-09-25T04:19:07.6835900Z [36;1m[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6836100Z [36;1m# ``tr -d '\r'``: on Windows the helper's redirected stdout gains[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6836630Z [36;1m# CRLF line endings; a stray \r would corrupt the path. The list[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6837030Z [36;1m# uses the native path-list separator consumed by --files.[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6837310Z [36;1m#[0m
