2026-09-25T04:19:07.6838010Z [36;1m# runner's own zero-run guard (every file filtered to empty by[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6838440Z [36;1m# ``-m`` — "must never pass without running its OS's tests").[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6838890Z [36;1mSEPARATOR="$(python -c 'import os, sys; sys.stdout.write(os.pathsep)')"[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6839320Z [36;1mFILES="$(tr -d '\r' < "$LIST" | paste -sd "$SEPARATOR" -)"[0m
2026-09-25T04:19:07.6839690Z [36;1mscripts/run_tests.sh --files "$FILES" -- \[0m
